  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation rur dev Est/Ru</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering glesb Est/Ry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med uppdraget &#xe4;r att utv&#xe4;rdera tv&#xe5; p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende Sidafinansierade landsbygdsprojekt i Karelen och Archangelsk. Utv&#xe4;rderingen skall kunna ge underlag f&#xf6;r Sidas st&#xe4;llningstagande till en eventuell forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; projekten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the evaluation is to acquire knowledge about the relevance, effects, impact, cost-effectiveness and sustainability of the Swedish support to two projects of rural development in Russia so far and to point out future development possibilities as well as lessons to be learned.</narrative>
  </description>
